                                "sense_id": "dbfb8375-d3dc-3cbb-b29b-2791db882fdf",
                                "text": "The trivialities and subtle sensuous suggestions of Da Majano, and the mingled puerilities, coarse wit, the sboccata ciarla (foulmouthedness) of Cecco Angiolieri, who nevertheless would assert his right to claim some relationship with the master, are surely sufficient proof and illustration of this."
